# PSR-2a — Documentation authority bootstrap

## Goal

Stand up **`docs/index.yaml`** as the sole active-doc registry and lock the
metadata schema (**DOC-META-001**) without TEMP promotion, phase archival, or
bulk frontmatter migration of the historical corpus.

## Delivered

| Artifact | Role |
| --- | --- |
| [`docs/standards/doc-authority-metadata.schema.mdoc`](../../standards/doc-authority-metadata.schema.mdoc) | `standard` — required fields + role enum |
| [`docs/index.yaml`](../../index.yaml) | Machine registry (seed = 10 active docs) |
| `scripts/ops/psr-2a-validate-docs-index.mjs` | Ops validator (no new public root command) |

## Seed set (active authority only)

Program remediation, Denali Gravity canonical + example, PSR-0/1/2a snapshots,
and the metadata schema. Phase packs and deferred dirty docs are **not** seeded.

## Explicit non-goals (later waves)

| Wave | Work |
| --- | --- |
| PSR-2b | Zero tracked→ignored TEMP/temp authority; promote or drop links |
| PSR-2c | Archive closed phase packs; ROOT_COMMAND consolidation ≤3 |
| PSR-3 | Public `guard:docs-manifest` via family merge (not net-new root cmd) |

## Commit ledger

| Item | Status | Commit |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Schema + index + validator + seed frontmatter | done | (this wave) |

## Exit gate

| Criterion | Result |
| --- | --- |
| `docs/index.yaml` exists with `schema_version: 1` | Pass |
| Seed docs have DOC-META-001 frontmatter | Pass (10 indexed) |
| `node scripts/ops/psr-2a-validate-docs-index.mjs` exits 0 | Pass |
| TEMP/temp untouched; defer docs unstaged | Pass |
| No new public root `package.json` script | Pass |

**PSR-2a gate: GREEN.**
